{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつのまにか8月後半ですね🫢"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "12公演の長いツアー期間だと思っていたけど、\nいつの間にか残り4公演！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Buddies の皆さんと過ごす夏はいつも以上にあっという間に感じるよ〜。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "既に夏が恋しいです、、。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まだ花火できてない！\nやらないと！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを開いていただき、\nありがとうございます！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "埼玉県出身のえんどうりこです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobFJZ9P9.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/moboveGpc.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Sakurazaka46 ARENA TOUR 2026\n-What's lonesome?-"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "広島公演、千葉公演、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございました！！🎶"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobjTcnVA.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こちらは広島でのお好み焼き！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "夜ご飯に半分こで食べました☺︎\nおいしすぎて箸が止まらなくなりました、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mob8Heaow.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobwLAgfa.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "夏はかき氷だー🍧\n沢山食べたのは秘密！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "何杯食べたと思うー？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私はレモンがお気に入りです！！🍋"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobhkaIbP.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あいりたん！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今年も揚げもみじ半分こして食べたんだ〜🍁"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobDnu9z5.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私はももちゃんのお顔がすきみたい🙂‍↕️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobqtkGAo.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "凪ちゃん！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/moblr2nGA.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "CHIBA！！！\n上の方まで沢山\nみんなのこと見つけました〜👀"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobm56i72.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いろんなふなっしーいた！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ジャンボくんははじめましてだったよ〜\nかわいい🫶"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mob5mSji5.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "しあわせだ〜。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日は仙台に来ています！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ずんだ餅が大好きなので嬉しいです☺︎🫛"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobknQvRm.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ホタテ！！\nうま〜〜〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": 